# Paths that never enter a Docker build context (BETA-P0-017).
#
# Every image builds with the repository root as its context. No Dockerfile
# copies these today; excluding them means none can by accident, and the files
# are not even sent to the builder.
#
# The web tier's TLS certificate, private key, and the staged and previous
# copies scripts/tls-install.sh writes beside them.
infrastructure/docker/nginx/tls/
# ACME challenge tokens: not secret, but host state, not source.
infrastructure/docker/nginx/acme-webroot/

# Secrets and host state (private-beta security audit). The Dockerfiles copy
# whole service directories, so a `.env` or a credential that ends up inside
# one would otherwise ship in the image. Nothing copies any of these today.
.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
infrastructure/kind/generated/
infrastructure/observability/secrets/
infrastructure/observability/alertmanager/secrets/
backups/
